        "original_id": "966bb0cc-f2a6-56f3-a5fd-661e5c9299eb",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Julianna Margulies, Michael Crichton\n- TV Series: ER\n- Organizations: NBC, Emmy Awards\n- Roles: Carol Hathaway\n\nFacts:\n- ER is an American medical drama television series created by novelist and medical doctor Michael Crichton.\n- ER aired on NBC from September 19, 1994, to April 2, 2009, and ran for 331 episodes across 15 seasons.\n- After several small television roles, Julianna Margulies achieved wide recognition for playing Carol Hathaway on NBC's long-running medical drama ER.\n- Julianna Margulies won an Emmy Award for her role as Carol Hathaway on ER.",
